[[717,286,"The area is a known flood risk","standing water on road",""],[718,286,"Whilst the precise cause of the flooding is unknown, a more regular maintenance schedule may have prevented the buildup of vegetation within the gullies and therefore assisted in the drainage of the heavy rainfall experienced that day thus reducing the amount of surface water present on the road","vegetation blockage in gullies",""],[719,286,"The fact that only a Temporary Sign was in place in an area known for years to be a flood risk","inadequate signage for flood risk",""],[720,286,"The surface water was a contributory factor in this death","surface water contributing to collision",""],[4265,1629,"Sinnaiah crossed Dragon Street using the pelican crossing and | was told in evidence that she started to cross the road from the \"wrong side\" of the traffic light at the crossing, \"cutting the corner","pedestrian crossing from wrong side of traffic light",""]]